110 15 19128 0 0
1 3 0 100 0 1
E
hub~
Trimmed in a tarnished brass ring, the center of the wheel's hub is covered
by an opaque plate of crystalline material. Upon close examination, you see
that the hub itself is affixed with a hinge and a tight-fitting locking
mechanism.
~
E
spokes~
Heavy wooden spokes, banded in tarnished brass radiate outward from the
wheel's &whub&n. Several of the spokes appear to be broken, but hold fast
together as if held together by powerful magic forces.
~
E
wheel~
The &wspokes&n of the ship's great wheel radiate outward from a central hub,
cracked and weathered from the elements over the ages. Although the navigator
appears to control the wheel with ease, it does not move for you.
~
#19120
journal old~
an old journal~
Someone has left their journal here.~
~
18 cep a 0
0 0 0 0 0
1 3 10 100 0 1
E
journal old~
It seems to be the journal of an old explorer, you find an interesting
passage:

I have many times heard tales of the legendary Ghost Ship that occasionally
docks in the port cities of Alaozar and Xixieqi. Tonight I shall finally see
if those rumors are true, I shall stake out at the docks north of Alaozar and
try to come aboard the apparition, for I have heard there are hordes of jewels
and artifacts inside the ship's hold. I shall leave this journal with my
friend, who shall warn the populace of the threat that comes so close to home.

                                                             Twick Elmdaerle
~
